  "articleBody": "Choosing the right contractor for your restoration project is a big decision, and it can really make or break your experience. You want someone you can trust, right? First off, look for experience with similar projects. This isn't just about general remodeling; restoration can have its own unique challenges, like hidden damage or insurance claims. Clear supervision and communication are absolutely essential – you want to know what’s happening every step of the way. Ask for an itemized estimate so you understand exactly where your money is going. Don't be shy about asking for references; it’s a great way to hear about other people's experiences. You'll also want to know how they track the schedule and what their process is for handling change orders. Things can shift during a restoration, so transparency here is key. Finally, make sure they have a clear warranty process. For projects involving hidden damage, structural work, or complex coordination, a qualified professional becomes super important. At HH Remodeling LLC, we pride ourselves on open communication and reliable service to make your house feel more like a home. We’re a BBB Accredited Business with an A+ rating, and we’re here to help you through the process.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
